   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "RUN APPROVAL: the run attestor (an engine capability) recomputes the hashes and mints a RunApproval\napproval binds one run hash to one seat (no swap after the fact)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "RUN APPROVAL: the run attestor (an engine capability) recomputes the hashes and mints a RunApproval\napproval binds one run hash to one seat (no swap after the fact)",
