   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "COMMIT (sealed) - each juror mutates only its OWN JurySeat object\nchain sees hashes only; no outcome, no reasoning, no confidence\nsealed bundle on Walrus, reveal key escrowed with Seal (time-lock)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "COMMIT (sealed) - each juror mutates only its OWN JurySeat object\nchain sees hashes only; no outcome, no reasoning, no confidence\nsealed bundle on Walrus, reveal key escrowed with Seal (time-lock)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 15
  },
